NAME
       sort - sort lines of text

SYNOPSIS
       sort [-fnru] [file ...]

DESCRIPTION
       Writes the sorted concatenation of every FILE to standard
       output. With no FILE standard input is read.

OPTIONS
       -f     fold case while comparing
       -n     compare as numbers rather than as text
       -r     reverse the order
       -u     print only the first of a run of equal lines

SEE ALSO
       uniq(1), cut(1)
